        "end": 7.5,
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "text": "Halt! Who goes there? This sector has been closed since the power failed, and nobody is supposed to be down here."
      },
      {
        "start": 4.0,
        "end": 9.0,
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "text": "Show me your badge, slowly, and keep your hands where I can see them."
      },
      {
        "start": 7.0,
        "end": 15.0,
        "speaker": "Radio",
        "text": "Copy that, we have your signal. Backup is on the way, so hold your position and do not let anyone through that door until we get there."
      },
      {
        "start": 10.0,
        "end": 15.5,
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "text": "State your business, or turn around."
      },
      {
        "start": 13.0,
        "end": 20.0,
        "speaker": "Radio",
        "text": "Command says the lockdown holds until the generators are back, and that goes for everyone, no exceptions."
      },
      {
        "start": 20.3,
        "end": 21.0,
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "text": "Understood. Moving to the east gate now, over and out."
      },
      {
        "start": 20.8,
        "end": 21.5,
